rovable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span> (external Rosser-provability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" href=\"?note=d8d7d3ba56a05b13\" title=\"92-df-rosser-system\">92-df-rosser-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (variable, free-variable function, and substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar m\">\\(\\bar m\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (numerals and external standard truth)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (a fixed internal arithmetic formula chosen to define <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span> in the standard model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (candidate sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G,\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G,\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\\)</span> (definition-target representation and Rosser-sentence predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\bar m,v_0)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(R\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner},v_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G(m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\bar m,v_0)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RProvRep}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(R\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G,\\overline{\\ulcorner R\\urcorner},v_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : Rosser句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>断言自身没有Rosser证明；展开<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RProvCode}_G\\)</span>后，等价于“每个我的证明码之前都有一个更小的否定证明码”</li>\n<li>上式使用内部公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{RProv}}_G\\)</span>，而不是把外部数值关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>放进<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-公式中</li>\n<li>Rosser双向不可证定理只需要普通一致性而不需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性，但仍需要有效可公理化、足够算术强度与标准证明算术化</li>\n<li>Rosser技巧：用证明长度来替代<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性假设</li>\n<li>在满足上述附加条件的一致系统中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R\">\\(\\neg R\\)</span>都不可证；这不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G\\)</span>定义单独推出的事实</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"d8d7d3ba56a05b13","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering"